7
00:00:11,005 --> 00:00:13,415
October 27, 1962.

8
00:00:13,799 --> 00:00:15,759
The Cuban Missile Crisis had brought the

9
00:00:15,759 --> 00:00:18,199
United States and Soviet Union dangerously

10
